              "speakerAliasKey": "kofi_mensah#1",
              "speakerLabel": "Kofi",
              "text": "It's a warm building. I've been complaining about it for three hours.",
              "html": "It&#39;s a warm building. I&#39;ve been complaining about it for three hours.",
