              "speakerAliasKey": "dr_neve_okonkwo#2",
              "speakerLabel": "Neve",
              "text": "When they say it, I want it noted. In the report, and on the third line of a piece of paper I'm going to write myself.",
              "html": "When they say it, I want it noted. In the report, and on the third line of a piece of paper I&#39;m going to write myself.",
