              "speaker": "dr_neve_okonkwo",
              "speakerAliasKey": "dr_neve_okonkwo#2",
              "speakerLabel": "Neve",
              "text": "That one's been trouble. The lawyer wanted it out.",
              "html": "That one&#39;s been trouble. The lawyer wanted it out.",
